          "settings": {
            "question": "What's different about the Ultimate Recovery Mattress?",
            "answer": "<p>Rather than relying on petroleum-based foams, the Recovery Mattress combines certified organic cotton, breathable organic wool, GOLS-certified natural latex, and individually pocketed coils to create a sleep environment designed around comfort, airflow, and recovery.</p>"
