          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the philosophy behind the Ultimate Human Collection?",
            "answer": "<p>The collection is built around a simple principle: recovery starts with sleep, and better sleep starts with a cleaner environment. Every product is designed to combine certified organic materials, breathability, thoughtful craftsmanship, and lasting comfort.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7qDamM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why did Gary choose to enter the mattress industry?",
            "answer": "<p>After years of focusing on nutrition, movement, and human performance, Gary recognized that the place people spend nearly one-third of their lives was often overlooked. Finding a mattress built the way he believed it should be proved surprisingly difficult, leading to the creation of a collection that reflects his approach to recovery and sleep.</p>"
          }
